# Whitelist-style: everything excluded unless explicitly needed for a
# build. The repo carries GBs of ceremony/runtime data (g1-ceremony WAL
# segments, release artifacts) that must never enter a build context.
*

# Workspace manifest + shared config
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!.cargo
!.cargo/**

# Build inputs
!docker
!docker/shim.c
!dummy.rs
!lib
!lib/**
!app
!app/**
!packages
!packages/**
!contracts
!contracts/**
!tools
!tools/**
!vendor
!vendor/**

# Nested targets and caches never enter the context (rule order matters —
# these come after the includes so they win)
**/target
**/target/**
